# Statusphere
Bluesky's example app, in Spell:  set your status, an emoji, and see everyone's as they arrive.
Each status is a record in its owner's own atmosphere account, in the shape Statusphere's Lexicon says:  Status.spell.

// Every emoji to pick is a big, plain button
<ui-defaults>
	<ui-button size="large" appearance="basic"/>
</ui-defaults>

## A status:  the emoji, who set it, and when

<spell-more-of "status">
	<property "who" description="Its owner's handle, once their account says so;  else the account itself">
		set account to its owner
		set person to the first person in everyone here where its id is account
		if person is nothing
			return account
		return person's name
	</property>

	<draw>
		<stack direction="horizontal" align="center">
			<text size="big">{its status}</text>
			<text>@{its who}</text>
			<text color="grey" size="small">{its created at}</text>
		</stack>
	</draw>
</spell-more-of>


## The app:  the emoji to pick, then everyone's statuses, newest first

<spell-app "statusphere">
	<property "recent" description="Newest first:  by when each was set, the other way round">
		set found to every status sorted by its created at
		reverse found
		return found
	</property>

	<action "post (emoji as text)" description="Your status:  a new record in your own account, as Statusphere writes one">
		add (a new status with status = emoji, created at = a new date) to the statuses
	</action>

	<draw description="One narrow column:  its title, the emoji to pick, then the statuses">
		<container text>
			<stack align="start">
				<header size="large">Statusphere</header>
				<text color="grey">Set your status on the Atmosphere</text>
			</stack>
			<card fluid>
				<content>
					<header size="small">Set your status</header>
					<stack direction="horizontal" wrap>
						<button onClick={post "👍"}>👍</button>
						<button onClick={post "👎"}>👎</button>
						<button onClick={post "💙"}>💙</button>
						<button onClick={post "😎"}>😎</button>
						<button onClick={post "🦋"}>🦋</button>
						<button onClick={post "🚀"}>🚀</button>
					</stack>
				</content>
			</card>
			<header size="small">Recent</header>
			<for status in the recent loading="Finding statuses">
				<empty>
					<text color="grey">No statuses yet. Be the first!</text>
				</empty>
			</for>
		</container>
	</draw>
</spell-app>
